  "Filter SEALS by build": "Filtrar SELLOS por build",
  "Fine, fine, I'll go easy on you, curse you.": "Vale, vale, seré suave contigo, maldito seas.",
  "Fine.": "Vale.",
  "First Pentacle of Saturn": "Primer Pentáculo de Saturno",
