  "Most played SEAL": "最常用印记",
  "Most played build": "最常用构筑",
  "Multiple uses stack multiplicatively.": "多次使用会相乘叠加。",
  "Mummified Lamb appears twice as often in Devil's Offerings.": "木乃伊羔羊在恶魔献礼中出现的频率翻倍。",
  "Mummified Lamb": "木乃伊羔羊",
  "Music": "音乐",
  "My Devil's Offerings.": "我的恶魔献礼。",
  "My demons start complaining when they feel crammed, try opening up some more room for now.": "我的恶魔一挤就开始抱怨，先试着多腾点地方吧。",
  "My own SEAL, on an empty soul?": "我自己的印记，用一个空空的灵魂来换？",
  "My own SEAL?": "我自己的印记？",
  "My word is final.": "我的话就是最终决定。",
  "Myrrh": "没药",
  "Nahh, I think {OTHER} is a way better choice than {SEAL}.": "不，我觉得{OTHER}比{SEAL}好多了。",
  "Name the SEAL.": "说出那个印记。",
  "Nemesis": "宿敌",
  "Never guess what the others will guess.": "永远别猜其他人会猜的数字。",
  "Never liked that one.": "一直不喜欢那个。",
  "New Run": "新对局",
  "New non-boss DAMNED arrive with {n1} MEMORY.": "新的非BOSS罪人带着{n1}记忆到来。",
  "New non-boss DAMNED have a {n1}% chance to spawn with +{n2} BOUNTY.": "新的非BOSS罪人有{n1}%概率带着+{n2}负担出现。",
  "Next Round": "下一回合",
  "Next round, reveal its guess and give it +{n1} BOUNTY.": "下一回合，揭示其猜测并给他+{n1}负担。",
  "Next": "下一页",
  "Nice try.": "想得美。",
  "No ARTIFACTS": "没有法器",
  "No charge for a good little lapdog.": "乖乖的哈巴狗免费。",
  "No memory": "没有记忆",
  "No need to get defensive here you little flesh puppet!": "不用这么防备，小血肉傀儡！",
  "No no, wait please!": "不不，等等，求你了！",
  "No tracked effect yet.": "还没有记录的效果。",
  "No way I am trusting you after what the holy trio said to me.": "在神圣三人组跟我说了那些之后，我才不信你。",
  "No!!": "不！！",
  "No": "否",
  "Nobody could get closer this round, not even with my help.": "这回合没人能更接近了，就算有我帮忙也不行。",
  "None of it works, and you pay for the attempt.": "全都不管用，还得为尝试付钱。",
  "None": "无",
  "Not in my house.": "在我家不行。",
  "Not twice.": "不能两次。",
  "Nothing bound.": "未束缚任何东西。",
  "Nothing matches your search.": "没有符合搜索的结果。",
  "Now and then a DAMNED's guess is REVEALED before you choose.": "有时罪人的猜测会在你选择前被揭示。",
  "Now pay attention, because this is where every one of you fools fails.": "现在注意听，因为你们这些蠢货个个都在这里栽跟头。",
  "Now sit down and listen, I will explain my game once and only once.": "现在坐下听着，我只解释一次我的游戏。",
  "Now you're speaking my language.": "这才是我能听懂的话。",
  "Now, your first guess.": "好了，你的第一个猜测。",
  "Number pad": "数字键盘",
  "OH PLEASE, I will do literally anything and everything!": "哦求你了，我真的什么都愿意做！",
  "Of the Calling": "召唤之章",
  "Off by {DIST}.": "差了{DIST}。",
  "Oh, and one last thing, I'd recommend you beware.": "哦，还有最后一件事，我建议你小心点。",
  "Okay I get it, so I get the demons' power, I use the artifacts and after I defeat some other souls I go free, right?": "好，我懂了，所以我获得恶魔的力量，使用法器，打败一些别的灵魂之后就自由了，对吧？",
  "Okay listen here and listen well.": "好，听着，好好听着。",
  "Okay okay, I accept.": "好好，我接受。",
  "Okay okay, but I can change.": "好好，但我可以改。",
  "On exact TARGET, gain {n1} SIN.": "正中目标时，获得{n1}罪孽。",
  "Once a ritual is done, the ARTIFACT is gone.": "仪式完成后，法器就消失了。",
  "Once each round per DAMNED, when that DAMNED has taken more than {n1}% max-SOUL damage, it gains +{n2} BOUNTY.": "每回合每名罪人一次：当该罪人受到超过其最大灵魂{n1}%的伤害时，获得+{n2}负担。",
  "Once each round per DAMNED, when that DAMNED has taken more than {n1}% max-SOUL damage, its BOUNTY increases by {n2}.": "每回合每名罪人一次：当该罪人受到超过其最大灵魂{n1}%的伤害时，其负担增加{n2}。",
  "Once per ARTIFACT type each round, when you use two matching ARTIFACTS, deal {n1} damage to all DAMNED.": "每回合每种法器一次：当你使用两个相同的法器时，对所有罪人造成{n1}点伤害。",
  "Once per DAMNED per round, when it takes more than {n1}% of its max SOUL as damage, gain {n2} SIN.": "每回合每名罪人一次：当其受到超过最大灵魂{n1}%的伤害时，获得{n2}罪孽。",
  "Once the guesses are revealed and before you press READY, you get to use {n1} a round.": "猜测揭示后、你按下“就绪”之前，每回合可以使用{n1}。",
  "One chance is all you get my sweet summer slave.": "你只有一次机会，我甜美的夏日奴隶。",
  "Only Heaven and Hell, and there are no other Gods but me.": "只有天堂和地狱，除了我没有别的神。",
  "Only when it dies does another DAMNED take its place.": "只有它死了，才会有别的罪人取代它的位置。",
  "Open every SEAL slot you can, then you may come begging again.": "把能开的印记栏位都打开，然后再来求我。",
  "Open items": "打开的物品",
  "Open {pack} for {price} KARMA": "花{price}业力打开{pack}",
  "Options": "选项",
  "Our goals happen to align this fine time.": "这次我们的目标刚好一致。",
