  "Personality": "性格",
  "Pick a DAMNED.": "选择一名罪人。",
  "Pick a DAMNED; remove their guess from the TARGET average, though they still take damage.": "选择一名罪人；把他的猜测从目标平均值中移除，但他仍会受到伤害。",
  "Pick a DAMNED; their guess counts {n1} times for the TARGET average.": "选择一名罪人；他的猜测在目标平均值中计算{n1}次。",
