  "Revealed DAMNED gain +{n1} BOUNTY and +{n2} MEMORY, and the gains stay even if they are not revealed next round.": "已揭示的罪人获得+{n1}负担和+{n2}记忆，即使下一回合未被揭示，收益也会保留。",
