  "Shares one SEAL slot with the other Trinity SEALS (together, the SEAL of God).": "与其他三位一体印记共用一个印记栏位（合起来即神之印）。",
  "Shop": "商店",
  "Should He deny you a servant of His, do not plead.": "祂若拒绝给你祂的某位仆人，不要哀求。",
  "Show the game in this language, finished or not (missing text shows in English; Pseudo marks text that is not translatable yet)": "以此语言显示游戏，无论是否完成（缺失的文本以英语显示；Pseudo会标出尚无法翻译的文本）",
  "Shut your sacrilegious fucking mouth.": "闭上你那亵渎神明的臭嘴。",
  "Six is all you can get and the price is {PRICE}.": "你最多只能拿六个，价格是{PRICE}。",
  "Sixth Pentacle of Saturn": "土星第六五芒符",
  "Skip past the eight special bosses": "跳过八个特殊boss",
  "Slot machine and Satan's bet": "老虎机与撒旦的赌约",
  "Slot machine · {cost} a spin": "老虎机 · 每转{cost}",
  "So be thankful for once you are even getting the chance to prove yourself before me.": "所以就这一次，心存感激吧，你居然还有机会在我面前证明自己。",
  "So for an ELITE {OTHER} it's gonna run you {PRICE}.": "所以给{OTHER}升精英，要花你{PRICE}。",
  "So listen here, I got you a little offer.": "听着，我给你准备了个小提议。",
  "So please, just send me back and I promise I will do good this time.": "所以求你了，送我回去吧，我保证这次会做好事。",
  "So please, keep the SIN flowing and the sinners screaming, and maybe we shall meet again.": "所以请让罪孽继续流淌，让罪徒继续尖叫，也许我们还会再见。",
  "So you guess {GUESS}.": "所以你猜{GUESS}。",
  "So you want your second chance that bad?": "你就这么想要第二次机会？",
  "So, what does your wretched heart desire?": "那么，你那可悲的心想要什么？",
  "Solomon's pentacles?": "所罗门的五芒符？",
  "Some want a victim: use it, then click the DAMNED you want it on.": "有些需要受害者：使用后，再点击你想作用的罪人。",
  "Somebody's planning a party.": "有人在计划办派对。",
  "Somebody's planning to make some moves I see.": "看来有人打算有所行动。",
