  "Start each round by marking a DAMNED.": "每回合开始时标记一名罪人。",
  "Sticks to their instinct, no matter what.": "无论如何都坚持自己的直觉。",
  "Strongest SEAL in one round": "单回合最强印记",
  "Submit quality": "提交质量",
